<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Silverside AI: News Analysis</title>
    <!-- Chosen Palette: Silverside AI Dark Theme -->
    <!-- Application Structure Plan: A dashboard-style SPA with a primary navigation bar to filter content by key themes: Creative Adoption, Environmental Impact, and Agency Strategy. This thematic structure allows users to actively explore specific areas of interest rather than passively scrolling through all content. An aggregated "Key Takeaways" section, also filterable, provides a high-level summary for quick consumption. This design prioritizes user-driven exploration and information synthesis over the linear format of the original report. -->
    <!-- Visualization & Content Choices: Report Info -> Goal: Inform/Organize -> Presentation: The application uses interactive filtering of content cards (HTML/CSS) to organize news summaries. Goal -> Interaction: Users click theme buttons to dynamically show/hide relevant article cards and key takeaways. Justification: This interaction is intuitive and transforms a static document into an engaging, explorable dashboard, allowing users to compare themes and focus their attention. Library/Method: Vanilla JavaScript for state management and DOM manipulation. -->
    <!-- CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used. -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #111827; /* bg-gray-900 */
        }
        .nav-btn, .tag-btn {
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .nav-btn.active, .tag-btn.active {
            background-color: #00F0B5;
            color: #111827;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 181, 0.4);
        }
        .content-card, .takeaway-item {
            transition: opacity 0.5s ease-in-out, transform 0.5s ease-in-out;
            will-change: opacity, transform;
        }
        .hidden-item {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: scale(0.95);
            height: 0;
            margin-top: 0 !important;
            margin-bottom: 0 !important;
            padding-top: 0 !important;
            padding-bottom: 0 !important;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: none;
        }
        .silverside-logo svg {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
        }
        .header-bg {
            background-image: url('https://storage.googleapis.com/gemini-prod/images/4552a46c-1798-472d-8686-fd573a6283f5');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: #00F0B5;
            color: #111827;
            padding: 0 2px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .save-btn svg {
            transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }
        .save-btn.saved svg {
            fill: #00F0B5;
            stroke: #00F0B5;
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }
        .loader {
            border: 2px solid #f3f3f3;
            border-top: 2px solid #00F0B5;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        .modal-backdrop.hidden {
            display: none;
        }
        .modal-content {
            transition: transform 0.3s ease-out, opacity 0.3s ease-out;
        }
        .modal-backdrop.hidden .modal-content {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(-20px) scale(0.95);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
        <header class="header-bg relative text-center mb-12 rounded-xl border border-gray-700 overflow-hidden py-16">
