                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white">Silverside AI</h1>
                </div>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 mt-2">Interactive News Analysis: AI in the Creative Sphere</p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main class="bg-gray-800/50 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 sm:p-8 border border-gray-700">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                <p class="text-lg mb-8 text-gray-300">
                    Welcome to your interactive news roundup. The articles below explore the evolving relationship between AI and the creative, marketing, and production industries. Use the filters and tools below to navigate between key themes and discover targeted insights.
                </p>

                <div class="bg-gray-900/40 p-4 rounded-lg mb-8 border border-gray-700">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 items-end">
                        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
                            <label for="search-input" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 mb-1">Keyword Search</label>
                            <input type="text" id="search-input" class="w-full bg-gray-700 border-gray-600 text-white rounded-md shadow-sm focus:ring-[#00F0B5] focus:border-[#00F0B5]" placeholder="Search summaries...">
